   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Sakari manages a retail outlet. They receive a shipment of shirts. She sees on the shipping list that each shirt cost 24.50 to the store. The store marks up the shirts by 45%. The county in which she lives charges sales tax of 6.5%. What is the retail price of one of the shirts? After sales tax, how much will a customer pay for the shirt?",
